# --- Vendored agent skills (npx skills add) ---
# ~11 MB of third-party markdown, duplicated across six directories, plus a
# postToolUse hook that runs node on every edit. Kept local: installed per
# machine with `npx skills add`, not carried in the repo.
/.claude/
/.agents/
/.codex/
/.github/agents/
/.github/hooks/
/.github/skills/
/skills-lock.json
